Error [E0116]: `shout` doesn't hand back a value
  --> tests/ui/valueless_call.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     x :: shout()
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: a call is a value only when its function declares a result after the parameter list
 Fix: inside an arm, wrap the call in `{ … }`; otherwise put `shout` on its own line, or declare it as `fn shout(…) Type -> …`
